    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "value": "<p data-block-key=\"vpvg8\">This is the Advanced Technology &amp; Academic Centre (ATAC). It is a high-tech teaching and learning centre that provides 1,400 student spaces and integrates advanced technology and smart communications into the learning environment. The ATAC features immersive Telepresence Classrooms that provide high-quality, alternative options for attending classes, meetings, and conferences.</p>",
